  "details": "More support for Quest in regards to world joining, world loading, avatars, tracking crashers, etc. I have noticed lately when joining some worlds my game crashes. There are times moreso frequently when joining worlds where I am hit with people crashing the world's from their avatar, even though safety settings are on (usually these are quest avatars and users that are underage causing this). Other times when I am in worlds it will happen randomly from users. A way to track this so proper reporting would be useful. More support for Quest is needed as well as the recent updates have been troublesome; loading/crashing etc.",
